<div id="page-content-wrapper" class="rapor-workspace"><nav class="navbar top-navbar px-4 py-3"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-0">Administrasi rapor</h5></nav>
<main class="container-fluid p-3 p-md-4 rapor-content rapor-admin">
<div class="rapor-intro"><div><h1><i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-check rapor-title-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i> Monitoring rapor</h1><p>Siapkan pengaturan, pantau kelengkapan setiap kelas, dan kelola penerbitan rapor.</p></div></div>
<?php if($error): ?><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert"><?= sanitize($error) ?></div><?php endif ?>
<?php if($success): ?><div class="alert alert-success" role="status"><?= sanitize($success) ?></div><?php endif ?>
<?php if(!$ready): ?><div class="alert alert-warning">Penyimpanan rapor belum tersedia. Siapkan tabel rapor terlebih dahulu.</div><?php endif ?>
<?php if(!$adminReady): ?><div class="alert alert-warning">Monitoring tetap tersedia. Pengaturan wali kelas dan penguncian memerlukan tabel administrasi rapor.</div><?php endif ?>
